Pet artwork
-----------
This plugin does **not** bundle the pet artwork. At runtime it resolves the
upstream npm package `@michengai/dsh-codex-pet` via
`require.resolve('@michengai/dsh-codex-pet/package.json')` and reads the sprite
sheets from `<root>/assets/codex/<pet>/spritesheet.webp`. The upstream package is
a dependency, not a copy: no sprite sheet is included in this repository, in this
npm package, or in any distribution of it.

The upstream package's NOTICE states that the pet artwork under `assets/codex`
originates from OpenAI Codex and is not original artwork of that project; its
Apache License 2.0 grants no new rights to that third-party artwork or its
trademarks, and those rights remain with their respective owners.

The plugin icon `assets/icon.png` is a single-frame derivative cropped from that
artwork, so it likewise originates from OpenAI Codex and is not covered by this
plugin's MIT license.

This is a community-maintained project. It is not affiliated with, and is not an
official product of, OpenAI or DeepSeek.
